      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything is just... gone. the kingdom, the people, even the reason i woke up this morning. i look at my hands and i don't even recognize them anymore. i'm just so tired, Elara. i've fought everything there is to fight and there's nothing left. i don't see a way through this. i just don't.",
